  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ところで、思念石が十人分
としても、ギリギリの人数しか
いないけど、ど〜すんのさ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...By the way, even if the Will Stone can make up for ten people, aren't we still kinda scraping by?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>遠隔リンクの発動は
リチア様と我が隊だけで十分だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Between Lady Lithia and my party, we should suffice to activate the remote link.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らが、ひとりで
ふたり半の力を出せばいいのだ。
……できるな、お前たち！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We only need muster the power of two and a half men by ourselves... I know you have it in you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はっ、問題ありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Not a problem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>問題ありすぎ！
こんな重労働……
あとで訴えるからねッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh no, there are WAY too many problems! What is this slave labor... I'm totally issueing a complaint later!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分もリチア様と共に残ります</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I shall also remain by Master Lithia's side.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>サンドリオンの情報を持って
いるのは貴方だけです。
どうか皆を導いてあげてください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You are the only one with knowledge of Cendrillon. Please, go and guide them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……了解しました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Understood.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたくしが管理コア権限で
組みあげた『思念錠』です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is a “Will Lock” I was able construct given my authority as the management core.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これで降下命令をロックすれば
擬似管理コアのコランダームでは
解除できないはずですわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we can lock the descent command, not even the psuedo management core Corundum should be able to undo it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、みなさん……
スピルリンクの準備を！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now, everyone... prepare to Spirlink!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>第一段階として
思念石に遠隔リンク用の
思念術を書きこみます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Step one is engraving the Will Arte for remote linking into the Will Stone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くっ、第二段階……
わたくしとサンドリオンの
ソーマリンクを思念石に接続！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Urk, now for step two... connecting both Cendrillon and my own Somalinks to the Will Stone!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;……
まず、わたくしにスピルリンクを</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shing... start by Spirlinking with me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>次に、思念石の力に乗せて
サンドリオンまで、あなたたちを
弾き飛ばします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Next, I'll harness the power of the Will Stone to shoot you all the way to Cendrillon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>サンドリオンのスピリアを
感じたらダブルリンクして下さい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once you can sense Cendrillon's Spiria, initiate a secondary link.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は、弾き飛ばすぅ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, SHOOT?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あ、そ〜だ。
ボク、ノークインに
『あったかカイロ』忘れてきた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I toootally forgot! I think I left my handwarmers back in Norqueen...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、行ってくる！
思いっきりぶっとばしてよ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, let's get going! Fire at will!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最終段階……
思念石の力を暴走させます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And the final stage... is making sure the Will Stone doesn't spiral out of control.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>みなさんは
暴走した力を押さえこんで
わたくしに叩き付けてください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Everyone, please help supress the excess energy and divert it to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その力でリンクラインをこじ開け
サンドリオンへの通路にします!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll use that power to pry open the link line and make a passage to Cendrillon!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっ……叩き付けるだの
こじ開けるだの強引すぎだって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait... all that banging and crashing sounds SUPER dangerous!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな巨大な力をぶつけたら
あなたのスピリアが
吹き飛ぶかもしれないぞ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you were to be hit by such a force, couldn't your Spiria be blown away?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仲間を死地に追いこむ
わたくしが、この程度の危険
から逃げる訳にはいきません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I am to drive my dear companions to their deaths, I myself cannot cower in the face of danger.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それに、ナメないでください。
こう見えても、わたくしは
結晶界最高位の思念術士です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And please, do not underestimate me. Appearances may be decieving, but I was the most powerful Will mage in all of Quartzia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……認めましょう。
リチア＝スポデューン……
あなたは真の騎士だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I stand corrected. Lithia Spodune... you are a true knight, through and through.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バイロクス、ペリドット
遅れをとるなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You two better not lag behind!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>63448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>承知!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Understood!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>64604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うう、ど〜なっても
あたしは責任とらないよッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uhh, I won't be held accountable for whatever happens!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75804</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192301</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うう、バイロクス……
付きあってあげるから、あたしの
担当、半分持ってくんない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh, Byrox... how 'bout taking over for me? I'll pay you back~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192302</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……全力で断る。
どうせ助けるならリチア様がいい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Absolutely not. I'd rather assist Lady Lithia.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76060</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192303</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うわっ、バイロクスって……
実はロリ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa Byrox, are you... into the younger crowd?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192304</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あら、多分わたくしの方が
年上だと思いますわ……
……二千才ほど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now now, I believe I'd be a bit older than you'd think... by about two-thousand years.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192305</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、そっか！　リチア様
ウチの隊長、年上好きだから
気をつけた方がいいかもよぉ〜</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I see! Captain's into the older ladies, so you better watch out Lady Lithia~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76564</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192306</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>しゅ、集中せんか、バカ者ども！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shh, SOME of us are trying to concentrate!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192307</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……こ、これは……!?
何かがリンクラインを
さかのぼって来る！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...W-what's happening?! Something's coming through the link line!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192308</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きゃぁぁぁ〜〜〜ッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eeek!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>85484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192309</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ああ、思念石が!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh no, the Will Stone just...?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>85808</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192310</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うう、ラピスのスピルーン
……取り戻せなかった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I... I couldn't recover Lapis' Spirune!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>86244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192311</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;、状況を報告しろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shing, what happened?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>86628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192312</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……サ、サンドリオンに
降下命令は出せたけど
クリードに弾き返されちゃった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We were able to order Cendrillon to descend, but Creed forced us out...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>87512</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192313</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……しかも、ご丁寧に
ゼロムの、お土産付きの
ようですな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And it appears he left us with a little xerom souvenir...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>92252</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192314</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>警告！　ゼロムたちは
ノークインに向かっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Warning! Xerom are approaching Norqueen at a rapid rate!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>92380</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192315</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クソッ！
このままじゃ里が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn it! At this rate, the village is doomed!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>92964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192316</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>リチアッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lithia?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
