    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>94908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192317</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すまん……
今の我らには、まともに動くだけの
力は残っていない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Apologies... we don't have enough strength left to walk..</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>95036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192318</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたくしにかまわず里へ……
シーラたちを守って……ください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't worry about me and hurry to the village... please, protect Shiela and the others.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>95164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192319</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、思念力の防御なしで
こんな冬山に置き去りにしたら
命に関わるわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it's not safe to just leave you out in the snow without the barrier.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>95548</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192320</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バカ野郎……
そんなに自分を犠牲にしてぇか？
……だったらッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You idiot... why are you so eager to sacrifice yourself? In that case...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192321</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;、わたくしに
かまっていては里が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hisui, if you concern yourself with me, the village will...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96412</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192322</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うるせぇ！
てめぇはコート代わりだ！
犠牲になって背中をあっためてろ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Zip it! You're my coat now! All you gotta worry about is keepin' me warm!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>96608</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192323</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私たちもカルセドニーたちを
コート代わりに全力疾走……
できるわねッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can still book it with our fancy new coats... we can make it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>99196</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192324</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……
貴様に背負われるとは
末代までの恥だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tch... I'm so ashamed to have to be carried by you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>99324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S192325</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へへへ、そうさ！
その『恥ずかしい』って想いも
必ず未来へつなげるんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe, yup! But that embarassment will carve out a new tomorrow!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
